></div><div data-cursor="view" class="mt-5 flex cursor-pointer items-start justify-between gap-6 transition-opacity duration-700 ease-soft"><div class="min-w-0"><p class="mono-label text-charcoal/55">No. <span>06</span></p><h3 class="mt-2 font-heading text-[clamp(1.75rem,2.3vw,2.4rem)] leading-none" data-mdlfy-cms="pieces:6ef44889-71cc-407c-b67c-dc81ceb57524:name">Stem Bottle</h3><p class="mt-2 text-[0.875rem] text-charcoal/65"><span data-mdlfy-cms="pieces:6ef44889-71cc-407c-b67c-dc81ceb57524:glaze_name">Speckled cream</span></p></div><div class="shrink-0 text-right"><p class="mono-label">€<span>64</span></p><p class="mono-label mt-2 text-charcoal/55"><span data-mdlfy-cms="pieces:6ef44889-71cc-407c-b67c-dc81ceb57524:dimensions">Ø 70 × 230 mm</span></p></div></div><p class="mono-label mt-3 text-charcoal/60">Batch of <span>14</span> · <span>6</span> left</p></article></li><li class="snap-start"><aside class="flex aspect-[4/5] w-[min(76vw,calc(min(46vh,40rem)*0.8))] flex-col justify-between border border-charcoal/15 p-7 md:w-[min(26vw,calc(min(48vh,42rem)*0.8))] md:p-8"><p class="mono-label text-charcoal/55">Commissions</p><div><p class="font-heading text-[clamp(1.9rem,2.6vw,2.75rem)] leading-[1.02]">A set for your table, a café or a wedding?</p><p class="mt-4 text-[0.9375rem] leading-relaxed text-charcoal/70">Tell us what you need and we will throw it in one run, so every piece belongs together.</p></div><a href="mailto:hello@argjile.studio?subject=Commission%20enquiry" class="group inline-flex items-center gap-3 self-start text-[0.9375rem]"><span class="link-sweep">Write to the studio</span><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" class="size-4 shrink-0 rotate-0 transition-transform duration-500 ease-soft group-hover:translate-x-1"><path d="M3 12H20.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.25" stroke-linecap="round"></path><path d="M14.5 5.5C15.6 8.4 17.7 10.8 20.5 12C17.7 13.2 15.6 15.6 14.5 18.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.25" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></a></aside></li></ol></div><div class="px-[6vw] pb-8 pt-6"><div class="relative h-px w-full bg-charcoal/15"><span class="absolute inset-0 origin-left bg-charcoal" style="transform:scaleX(0.02)"></span></div></div></div></section><section id="process" data-surface="dark" aria-labelledby="process-title" class="relative bg-charcoal text-bone" style="height:380vh"><div class="sticky top-0 flex h-screen flex-col overflow-hidden px-[6vw] pb-8 pt-24 supports-[height:100svh]:h-svh md:pb-12 md:pt-28"><div class="flex items-center gap-5 text-bone/70"><p class="mono-label whitespace-nowrap">04<!-- --> — <!-- -->Process</p><span aria-hidden="true" class="h-px flex-1 bg-current opacity-20"></span><p class="mono-label whitespace-nowrap">01 / 04</p></div><div class="mt-6 grid min-h-0 flex-1 grid-rows-[auto_minmax(0,1fr)] gap-6 md:mt-10 md:grid-cols-12 md:grid-rows-1 md:gap-10"><div class="flex flex-col md:col-span-5 md:justify-center"><h2 id="process-title" data-reveal="" class="font-heading text-[clamp(2.4rem,min(5vw,8.5vh),5.25rem)] leading-[0.92] tracking-[-0.015em]"><span class="reveal-line"><span style="transition-delay:0s">From lump</span></span><span class="reveal-line"><span style="transition-delay:0.1s">to kiln.</span></span></h2><ol class="mt-8 hidden md:mt-10 md:block"><li class="border-t border-bone/15"><button type="button" aria-current="step" class="group flex w-full items-baseline gap-6 py-4 text-left xl:py-5"><span class="w-14 font-heading text-[2.25rem] leading-none transition-colors duration-700 ease-soft text-terracotta">01</span><span class="flex-1"><span class="block font-heading text-[2rem] leading-none transition-colors duration-700 ease-soft text-bone">Wedge</span></span><span class="mono-label transition-colors duration-700 ease-soft text-bone">20 min</span></button><div class="grid transition-[grid-template-rows,opacity] duration-1000 ease-soft grid-rows-[1fr] opacity-100"><p class="overflow-hidden pb-0 pl-20 text-[0.975rem] leading-relaxed text-bone/70"><span class="block pb-6">Every throw starts at the bench. The clay is folded and pressed in a slow spiral until the air is gone and the body feels the same all the way through. Skip it and the kiln finds every bubble.</span></p></div></li><li class="border-t border-bone/15"><button type="button" class="group flex w-full items-baseline gap-6 py-4 text-left xl:py-5"><span class="w-14 font-heading text-[2.25rem] leading-none transition-colors duration-700 ease-soft text-bone/25 group-hover:text-bone/50">02</span><span class="flex-1"><span class="block font-heading text-[2rem] leading-none transition-colors duration-700 ease-soft text-bone/40 group-hover:text-bone/70">Throw</span></span><span class="mono-label transition-colors duration-700 ease-soft text-bone/40">1 hr</span></button><div class="grid transition-[grid-template-rows,opacity] duration-1000 ease-soft grid-rows-[0fr] opacity-0"><p class="overflow-hidden pb-0 pl-20 text-[0.975rem] leading-relaxed text-bone/70"><span class="block pb-6">Centred, opened, pulled, shaped. One vessel at a time on the wheel, then left under cloth overnight to firm up before the foot is trimmed by hand.</span></p></div></li><li class="border-t border-bone/15"><button type="button" class="group flex w-full items-baseline gap-6 py-4 text-left xl:py-5"><span class="w-14 font-heading text-[2.25rem] leading-none transition-colors duration-700 ease-soft text-bone/25 group-hover:text-bone/50">03</span><span class="flex-1"><span class="block font-heading text-[2rem] leading-none transition-colors duration-700 ease-soft text-bone/40 group-hover:text-bone/70">Dry &amp; Bisque</span></span><span class="mono-label transition-colors duration-700 ease-soft text-bone/40">7–10 days</span></button><div class="grid transition-[grid-template-rows,opacity] duration-1000 ease-soft grid-rows-[0fr] opacity-0"><p class="overflow-hidden pb-0 pl-20 text-[0.975rem] leading-relaxed text-bone/70"><span class="block pb-6">Pieces dry slowly on pine shelves so the walls shrink evenly. The first firing, to 950 °C, turns fragile clay into something porous and permanent.</span></p></div></li><li class="border-t border-bone/15"><button type="button" class="group flex w-full items-baseline gap-6 py-4 text-left xl:py-5"><span class="w-14 font-heading text-[2.25rem] leading-none transition-colors duration-700 ease-soft text-bone/25 group-hover:text-bone/50">04</span><span class="flex-1"><span class="block font-heading text-[2rem] leading-none transition-colors duration-700 ease-soft text-bone/40 group-hover:text-bone/70">Glaze &amp; Fire</span></span><span class="mono-label transition-colors duration-700 ease-soft text-bone/40">36 hrs</span></button><div class="grid transition-[grid-template-rows,opacity] duration-1000 ease-soft grid-rows-[0fr] opacity-0"><p class="overflow-hidden pb-0 pl-20 text-[0.975rem] leading-relaxed text-bone/70"><span class="block pb-6">Each piece is dipped in glazes we mix in the studio, fired to 1240 °C and left to cool for a day and a half. Opening the kiln never gets old.</span></p></div></li></ol></div><div class="relative flex min-h-0 flex-col md:col-span-6 md:col-start-7"><div class="relative min-h-0 flex-1"><svg viewBox="0 0 480 480" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" data-active="true" class="transition-opacity duration-700 ease-soft opacity-100 absolute inset-0 m-auto h-full max-h-[34rem] w-full max-w-[34rem] text-bone"><path d="M92 446V346H32V330H448V346H388V446" pathLength="1" class="draw-path" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="transition-delay:0.15s"></path><path d="M150 330C138 296 152 258 192 248C226 240 258 239 292 247C334 257 350 300 336 330" pathLength="1" class="draw-path" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="transition-delay:0.43000000000000005s"></path><path d="M226 246C234 270 236 300 230 330M258 245C250 270 250 300 256 330" 