und" style="transition-delay:0s"></path><path d="M176 252C176 212 204 186 240 186C276 186 304 212 304 252M222 186V176H258V186" pathLength="1" class="draw-path" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="transition-delay:0s"></path><path d="M240 176V108M222 108H258M228 96L240 108L252 96" pathLength="1" class="draw-path" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="transition-delay:0s"></path><path d="M190 262V278M212 266V286M268 266V282M292 262V274" pathLength="1" class="draw-path" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="transition-delay:0s"></path><path d="M392 166C374 148 380 124 396 108C398 126 412 130 410 148C418 140 420 130 418 118C434 134 438 158 426 174C416 188 400 188 392 166Z" pathLength="1" class="draw-path" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="transition-delay:0s"></path></svg><span aria-hidden="true" class="absolute right-0 top-0 hidden h-full w-px bg-bone/15 md:block"><span class="absolute inset-0 origin-top bg-bone/70" style="transform:scaleY(0.02)"></span></span></div><div class="mt-4 md:hidden" aria-live="polite"><div class="flex items-baseline gap-4"><span class="font-heading text-[2rem] leading-none text-terracotta">01</span><span class="font-heading text-[1.9rem] leading-none">Wedge</span><span class="mono-label ml-auto text-bone/60">20 min</span></div><p class="mt-3 text-[0.9375rem] leading-relaxed text-bone/70">Every throw starts at the bench. The clay is folded and pressed in a slow spiral until the air is gone and the body feels the same all the way through. Skip it and the kiln finds every bubble.</p><div class="mt-5 flex gap-2"><button type="button" aria-label="Step 01: Wedge" class="flex h-6 flex-1 items-center"><span class="block h-px w-full transition-colors duration-700 bg-bone"></span></button><button type="button" aria-label="Step 02: Throw" class="flex h-6 flex-1 items-center"><span class="block h-px w-full transition-colors duration-700 bg-bone/20"></span></button><button type="button" aria-label="Step 03: Dry &amp; Bisque" class="flex h-6 flex-1 items-center"><span class="block h-px w-full transition-colors duration-700 bg-bone/20"></span></button><button type="button" aria-label="Step 04: Glaze &amp; Fire" class="flex h-6 flex-1 items-center"><span class="block h-px w-full transition-colors duration-700 bg-bone/20"></span></button></div></div><p class="mono-label mt-4 hidden text-bone/50 md:block">01<!-- --> — <!-- -->Wedge<!-- -->, <!-- -->20 min</p></div></div></div></section><section id="studio" aria-labelledby="studio-title" class="relative bg-bone px-[6vw] pb-28 pt-24 md:pb-40 md:pt-32"><div class="flex items-center gap-5"><p class="mono-label whitespace-nowrap">05<!-- --> — <!-- -->Studio</p><span aria-hidden="true" class="h-px flex-1 bg-current opacity-20"></span></div><div class="mt-14 grid gap-16 md:mt-24 md:grid-cols-12 md:gap-10"><div class="md:col-span-5"><h2 id="studio-title" data-reveal="" class="font-heading text-[clamp(3rem,6vw,6.5rem)] leading-[0.9] tracking-[-0.02em]"><span class="reveal-line"><span style="transition-delay:0s">A small studio</span></span><span class="reveal-line"><span style="transition-delay:0.1s">with a <em class="italic">loud</em> kiln.</span></span></h2><p class="reveal-settle mt-10 max-w-md text-[1.0625rem] leading-relaxed text-charcoal/80" style="transition-delay:0.2s">Argjilë is the Albanian word for clay. Ours is a single room in Prishtina with two wheels under north-facing windows, a long glazing bench and a kiln that hums through the night. Everything is thrown, trimmed, glazed and fired here, in small batches, by the same four hands.</p><ul class="mt-14 border-t border-charcoal/15"><li class="border-b border-charcoal/15 py-5"><p class="font-mono text-[clamp(1.35rem,2.1vw,1.9rem)] tracking-[-0.01em]"><span class="tabular-nums">2019</span><span> — Founded</span></p></li><li class="border-b border-charcoal/15 py-5"><p class="font-mono text-[clamp(1.35rem,2.1vw,1.9rem)] tracking-[-0.01em]"><span class="tabular-nums">1</span><span> kiln, </span><span class="tabular-nums">2</span><span> wheels</span></p></li><li class="border-b border-charcoal/15 py-5"><p class="font-mono text-[clamp(1.35rem,2.1vw,1.9rem)] tracking-[-0.01em]"><span>~</span><span class="tabular-nums">400</span><span> pieces a year</span></p></li></ul></div><div class="reveal-settle md:col-span-6 md:col-start-7 md:pt-4" style="transition-delay:0s"><figure class="w-full"><div class="relative border border-charcoal/15 p-4 md:p-6" style="background:#E9E1D3"><svg viewBox="0 0 560 440" fill="none" class="h-auto w-full text-charcoal" role="group" aria-label="Floor plan of the studio"><g stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.1" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" opacity="0.85"><path d="M40 40H520V400H360M300 400H40V40" stroke-width="2.2"></path><path d="M300 400V344M300 344A56 56 0 0 1 356 400" stroke-dasharray="3 4"></path><path d="M96 34H200M96 46H200M260 34H364M260 46H364"></path></g><text x="330" y="426" class="fill-charcoal/50 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em]">Entrance</text><text x="148" y="26" class="fill-charcoal/50 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em]" text-anchor="middle">North light</text><g tabindex="0" role="button" aria-label="Wheel area. Two wheels by the window. Most throwing happens here before ten." aria-pressed="false" data-cursor-hover="" class="cursor-pointer outline-none"><rect x="78" y="70" width="164" height="136" rx="2" class="transition-[stroke,fill,stroke-opacity] duration-500 ease-soft fill-transparent stroke-charcoal" stroke-opacity="0.18" stroke-dasharray="4 5" stroke-width="1"></rect><g stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.1" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="transition-colors duration-500 ease-soft text-charcoal"><circle cx="128" cy="118" r="24"></circle>